 BSE| Energy difference of last empty index to LUMO [eV]                 103.538
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected occupied MOs                                     16
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected empty MOs                                        35
 BSE|
 BSE| No truncation of BSE matrices applied
 BSE|
